# Third-party product photography. Not ours to ship or version.
Yamaha-*.jpg

# Source material and generated artefacts, not source code.
# icons.zip alone is 28 MB; a contact sheet embeds every screenshot as base64
# and is rebuilt by `node e2e/tools/contact-sheet.mjs` whenever it is wanted.
# Git keeps a blob forever once committed, so these stay out of history.
*.zip
design/redesign/compare/
e2e/out/

# The Figma exports behind design/figma/spec: the SVGs (13 MB, text outlined)
# and the 2× PNG renders made from them are derivable; the spec text, the CSS
# paste and the frame PNGs are what the app is built from, and stay tracked.
design/figma/svg/
design/figma/png/
